---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Info" showLogo>
  <main class="w-sm mx-auto h-full">
    <div class="mt-16 flex flex-col gap-4">
      <ul>
        <li>
          Ceremony: 2pm at{" "}
          <a
            class="link"
            href="https://www.stnicholasbristol.org/"
            target="_blank"
          >
            St Nicholas Church
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Reception: 4pm at{" "}
          <a class="link" href="https://mud-dock.co.uk/" target="_blank">
            Mud Dock
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The whole day takes place in central Bristol, there is no car access or
        parking at the church, Mud Dock is on the harbourside, a{" "}
        <a
          class="link"
          target="_blank"
          href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/St+Nicholas+Church,+St+Nicholas+St,+Bristol+BS1+1UE/Mud+Dock+Caf%C3%A9,+40+The+Grove,+Bristol+BS1+4RB/@51.451635,-2.5964524,17z/data=!3m2!4b1!5s0x48718dd5f8b5b29b:0x5a0dcde1f0f0ba49!4m14!4m13!1m5!1m1!1s0x48718e79cc110307:0x809d8b2dbc05f071!2m2!1d-2.5925655!2d51.4539079!1m5!1m1!1s0x48718dd5fef0c59f:0xdd6f0e6a46f51f9c!2m2!1d-2.5955056!2d51.4492861!3e2?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkzMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D"
        >
          10 minute walk
        </a>{" "}
        away from St. Nicks.
      </p>
      <p>
        We’ll send out an update closer to the big day, as well adding in some
        recommended hotels and our favourite places to eat nearby.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8">
      <a
        href="/rsvp"
        class="p-4 bg-orange-500 font-serif font-bold text-xl rounded-full text-orange-50 leading-none flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5"
      >
        <span class="tracking-widest">RSVP</span> now
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
